{
  "title": "Hearty Ethiopian Vegetable Stir Fry",
  "description": "A salty, cheese-pull, nostalgic Ethiopian dish featuring tamarind-paste-makham, stir-fry, vegetarian-friendly, this recipe brings the flavors of Ethiopia to your table",
  "cuisine": "Ethiopian",
